      back facts(<xArrow>, at, end, mode)

task facts
  take type, like text
  take at, like number
  take end, like number
  take mode, like text
  like latex-facts
  mark private

  back
    make latex-facts
      bind type, type
      bind at, at
      bind end, end
      bind mode, mode
